  "description": "Cha Joo-yeon is a third-generation chaebol with flawless good looks. He seems perfect as Hee-soo’s boyfriend, but he has one fatal flaw: he’s a rampant playboy.\n\nExhausted by Joo-yeon's repeated betrayals, Hee-soo is approached one day by Kwon Do-han, a top-tier singer-songwriter.\n\n*“Use me. I’ll make you feel so good you won’t be able to think about anything else.”*\n\nWhat begins as an SM arrangement to get under Cha Joo-yeon’s skin quickly escalates, and Hee-soo finds himself sinking deeper and deeper into this risky affair... *(Source: Lezhin, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/trackzero)",
